From: Jaouen <74923920+JaouenMin41@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 04:32:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] arm64: dts: qcom: add Xiaomi POCO X3 Pro (vayu)

Forward-port the vayu device tree from the sm8150-mainline 6.4 branch
(Arseniy Velikanov) and extend it, using the Redmi K20 Pro (raphael)
device tree as a reference for the shared Xiaomi SM8150 bits:

  - DSI panel (Tianma / CSOT, one dtb per panel) with WLED backlight
  - Adreno 640 GPU
  - NT36672C SPI touchscreen as a panel follower
  - PM8150B charger, fuel gauge and USB Type-C role switching
  - flash LED, microSD, IR blaster, NFC (NXP NCI)
  - WiFi / Bluetooth (WCN3998), remoteprocs, UFS

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Maqjg6rG5ZJyxi8ZriSu69
